WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.650
You know, it's easy
to forget things.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.290
I mean, you forgot
your car keys, right?

3
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.690
You've forgotten your water
bottle on the way to the gym.

4
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.890
Have you ever
forgotten your shoes?

5
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.090
Like, that's crazy, right?

6
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.770
You get there and you're like,
I don't think I can work out in

7
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:14.810
my sandals, right?

8
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.170
So we forget things.

9
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.210
Why is that? Well, part of it
is our world that we live in.

10
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.570
I don't know if you realize
this, but our world is turning

11
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.530
incredibly fast. And I don't
mean the earth, I mean life.

12
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:32.580
And you are expected in this
world to be able to handle so

13
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.480
much information.

14
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.200
And isn't it in the middle of
all of that information while

15
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.000
trying to maintain your priorities,
while trying to maintain

16
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.030
your relationship with God,
while you know, while...

17
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.230
Ah, and you just forget.

18
00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.520
And sometimes the same is
true in our spiritual life.

19
00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.960
Sometimes we forget.

20
00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:56.440
But I don't want you to take
that and receive that and leave

21
00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:01.160
this session today going,
oh man, I've blown it again.

22
00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.600
I forgot how good God…

23
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.600
that's not the attitude.

24
00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.480
It's not the posture.

25
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.640
It's not even what
God wants for you.

26
00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:08.840
God doesn't want to condemn you.

27
00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.680
The Spirit wants to convict you.

28
00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.400
And so today, I want you
to receive some grace.

29
00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.800
I want you to take the hope
that you have in the Lord.

30
00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:17.140
I want you to smile.

31
00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.300
And I want you to go out into
the world full of energy.

32
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.100
And every time that God
reminds you of something

33
00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:29.540
that he's done in your life that
you've forgotten, I don't want

34
00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:31.310
you to say sorry.

35
00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.800
I want you to say thank you.

36
00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.500
Heavenly Father, Lord,
we just thank you.

37
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.500
We thank you for your goodness.

38
00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.660
We just thank you
for your grace, God.

39
00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:44.260
We thank you for your hope.

40
00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:48.180
And Lord, we thank you that
even in our limited capacity as

41
00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:53.220
humans, we forget so many things,
Lord, but that you never

42
00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:57.078
forget us. In Jesus' name, amen.

